      "label": "Utility announcement bar — optional, desktop only per the design brief (\"Optional narrow utility bar\"; the mobile header spec explicitly says \"No crowded icon row\", so this is suppressed under tablet_portrait). Rendered above the header via the bricks_before_header hook rather than folded into 01-header.json, so it can be toggled off independently. All-caps is NOT used here on purpose — the brief licenses all-caps for \"short eyebrow labels, utility navigation, small badges\" but this bar carries a full phone number and hours string, which reads badly all-caps."
